---
// EthicsDataBroker: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 300;
---
<figure class="edb">
  <div class="edb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Five stages: you, tracking, a company warehouse, a data broker that merges and resells, and buyers such as advertisers, insurers and background checks. Privacy moves from the user to the company.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Where the control goes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quyền kiểm soát đi về đâu</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Follow one person's behavior from a phone to a dossier for sale.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Theo dấu hành vi của một người từ điện thoại tới hồ sơ được rao bán.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="76" width="152" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={44} y={108} size={24} />
      <text x="66" y="112" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>You</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="168" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Browse, move,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Duyệt web, di</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="184" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>buy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chuyển, mua</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 172 108 L 192.0 108.0" /><polygon points="197,108 190.7,111.0 190.7,105.0" /></g>
      <rect x="197" y="76" width="152" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="phone" x={221} y={108} size={24} />
      <text x="243" y="112" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Tracking</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Theo dõi</tspan></text>
      <text x="197" y="168" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Logs scrolls, routes,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ghi lướt, lộ trình,</tspan></text>
      <text x="197" y="184" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>purchases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giao dịch</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 349 108 L 369.0 108.0" /><polygon points="374,108 367.7,111.0 367.7,105.0" /></g>
      <rect x="374" y="76" width="152" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={398} y={108} size={24} />
      <text x="420" y="103" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Company</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kho dữ liệu</tspan></text>
      <text x="420" y="120" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>warehouse</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>công ty</tspan></text>
      <text x="374" y="168" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Raw behavior</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hành vi thô</tspan></text>
      <text x="374" y="184" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>gets pooled</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bị gom lại</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 526 108 L 546.0 108.0" /><polygon points="551,108 544.7,111.0 544.7,105.0" /></g>
      <rect x="551" y="76" width="152" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="users" x={575} y={108} size={24} />
      <text x="597" y="103" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Data</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Môi giới</tspan></text>
      <text x="597" y="120" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>broker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dữ liệu</tspan></text>
      <text x="551" y="168" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Merges, scores,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ghép, chấm điểm,</tspan></text>
      <text x="551" y="184" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>resells dossiers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bán lại hồ sơ</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 703 108 L 723.0 108.0" /><polygon points="728,108 721.7,111.0 721.7,105.0" /></g>
      <rect x="728" y="76" width="152" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={752} y={108} size={24} />
      <text x="774" y="112" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Buyers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bên mua</tspan></text>
      <text x="728" y="168" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Ads, insurance,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quảng cáo, bảo hiểm,</tspan></text>
      <text x="728" y="184" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>background checks</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra lý lịch</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 96 226 L 445.0 226.0" /><polygon points="450,226 443.7,229.0 443.7,223.0" /></g>
      <text x="273" y="248" class="redtxt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Privacy moves from you to the company</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quyền riêng tư chuyển từ bạn sang công ty</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Privacy does not disappear along the way, it changes hands. By the last box you cannot see or correct what is said about you.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Quyền riêng tư không biến mất giữa đường, nó đổi chủ. Tới ô cuối bạn không còn thấy hay sửa được điều người ta nói về mình.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .edb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .edb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .edb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .edb text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .edb .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .edb .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edb .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .edb .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .edb .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .edb .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .edb .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .edb .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .edb .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edb .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .edb .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .edb .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edb .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edb .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .edb .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .edb .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .edb .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .edb .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edb .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .edb .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .edb .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .edb .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .edb .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .edb figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
